  "body": "<!-- THESIS: The user-selected studies form one connected Mycelium, with learning and community equally prominent.\nOWN-WORLD: Soil brown, forest, cool sage and stone; bold Manrope; photographic layers, plant sculpture and clear library controls.\nSTORY: Discover permaculture, find a starting point, and connect with others on Common Ground.\nFIRST VIEWPORT: Farm's seedling and large headline at home; panoramic type on About; big left-aligned titles and layered media in libraries. Equal learning/community actions remain on home.\nFORM: User-selected Farm-to-Fauna composition, Interstellar About and study-derived libraries. Selection key: mycelium-selected-studies-2026-10-16.\nFINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md --><a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a aria-label=\"Mycelium home\" class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Mycelium\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"88\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"230px\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/d6b5b92b-logo-be405390b89c-400.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></a><button aria-controls=\"site-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"menu-button\"><span>Menu</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></header>\n<nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"site-menu\" hidden=\"\" id=\"site-menu\"><div class=\"menu-links\"><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Videos</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/courses/\"><span>Courses</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/resources/\"><span>Resources</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"menu-route\" href=\"/about/\"><span>My story</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/events/\"><span>Events</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/newsletter/\"><span>Newsletter</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"footer-link\" href=\"/feedback/\"><span>Get in touch</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></nav><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"watch-intro\">\n<a class=\"watch-back\" href=\"/videos/#library\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg> All videos</a>\n<div class=\"watch-heading\"><h1>An Economist Prepares for the Polycrisis</h1><div class=\"watch-credit\"><p>With Garbi Jover</p><div class=\"watch-tags\"><span>Philippines</span><span>Podcast</span></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#the-idea\">Take a closer look <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"watch-stage\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"watch-depth\"></div><div class=\"watch-screen\"><button aria-label=\"Play An Economist Prepares for the Polycrisis\" class=\"watch-poster\" data-watch-embed=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/7Snl_oWqZzY?rel=0&amp;modestbranding=1\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"An Economist Prepares for the Polycrisis\" class=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"360\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 90vw\" src=\"/redesign/delivery/media/8c99dffb-hqdefault-3d4ab40a5f6c-480.webp\" srcset=\"/redesign/delivery/media/8c99dffb-hqdefault-3d4ab40a5f6c-320.webp 320w, /redesign/delivery/media/8c99dffb-hqdefault-3d4ab40a5f6c-480.webp 480w\" width=\"480\"/><span class=\"watch-play\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 32 32\"><path d=\"m12 7 14 9-14 9V7Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg><span>Play film</span></span></button></div></div>\n<div class=\"watch-source-line\"><span>From the Mycelium video library</span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Snl_oWqZzY\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Open original source <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"watch-reading\" id=\"the-idea\"><div class=\"watch-reading-heading\"><h2>The idea.<br/>In practice.</h2><nav aria-label=\"On this page\"><a href=\"#the-idea\">About the film</a><a href=\"#the-educator\">The educator</a><a href=\"#watch-next\">Keep exploring</a></nav></div><div class=\"watch-prose\"><div class=\"vd-body-text\"> <p>What does an economist do when the systems he studied start to break down? Garbi Jover left his career behind and returned to the land. In this conversation, Hubert Joseph Posadas of the Baganihan Collective frames the broader context: the polycrisis, a convergence of ecological collapse, food insecurity, economic instability, and geopolitical tension arriving all at once. Garbi shares the thinking behind his decision, what he learned in the transition, and why communities rooted in land and cooperation are the most resilient response to what is coming. Interviewed and presented by Hubert Joseph Posadas of the Baganihan Collective.</p> </div><div class=\"watch-question\"><h3>What would you try?</h3><p>Take one idea into your own space, or bring a question to the community.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/common-ground/\"><span>Discuss it in the Forum</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"watch-educator\" id=\"the-educator\"><div><p>Learn alongside</p><h2>Garbi Jover</h2><span>Economist</span></div><div class=\"watch-bio\"><p class=\"vda-bio\">Garbi Jover is an economist who chose to step away from conventional financial life to prepare for the polycrisis — a convergence of ecological, economic, and social breakdowns. He now advocates for land-based resilience and community sovereignty as a response to systemic collapse.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/videos/?search=Garbi%20Jover&amp;view=shelf#library\">More from this educator <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></div></section><section class=\"watch-related\" id=\"watch-next\"><header><h2>Keep exploring.</h2><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/videos/\"><span>Back to the library</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h16M13 5l7 7-7 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></a></header><div class=\"library-grid\"><article class=\"library-card filter-item\" data-category=\"philippines talk\" data